22
00:00:39,327 --> 00:00:41,199
It doesn't just reflect blue light; it

23
00:00:41,199 --> 00:00:43,072
actively removes other colors from the light

24
00:00:43,072 --> 00:00:44,945
spectrum.

25
00:00:44,945 --> 00:00:46,818
When sunlight, which contains all visible colors,

26
00:00:46,818 --> 00:00:48,690
