27
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:50,563
those surrounding Uranus and Neptune – something

28
00:00:50,563 --> 00:00:52,436
extraordinary happens.

29
00:00:52,436 --> 00:00:54,309
The methane molecules are particularly efficient at

30
00:00:54,309 --> 00:00:56,181
