37
00:01:07,418 --> 00:01:09,290
This selective absorption isn't magic; it's pure

38
00:01:09,290 --> 00:01:11,163
physics.

39
00:01:11,163 --> 00:01:13,036
Methane molecules have specific vibrational and rotational

40
00:01:13,036 --> 00:01:14,909
