53
00:01:37,381 --> 00:01:39,254
called chemiluminescence.

54
00:01:39,254 --> 00:01:41,127
So, whether it's the deep azure of

55
00:01:41,127 --> 00:01:43,000
distant gas giants or the clean burn

56
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,872
of a natural gas flame, methane's unique

57
00:01:44,872 --> 00:01:46,745
molecular properties are responsible for creating these

58
00:01:46,745 --> 00:01:48,618
